	Section:
		Text: References and links
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Links on boxes
		Paragraph: `Link` makes the whole box clickable. Its target is an `https://` or `http://` address, a `mailto:` address or `#id`, the box of the document with that `Id`. A link has no look of its own: the blue bold of these lines comes from a style.
			Style: intro
		Text: Link: https://stxt.dev
			Style: label
		Text: Visit stxt.dev
			Style: link
			Link: https://stxt.dev
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 14 0
		Text: Link: mailto:workshop@nogal.example
			Style: label
